VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'With Lottie Creator 2.0, product motion finally lives where you work, &gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; your browser. Inside, you\'ve got a co-pilot. Leave the hard work to the AI so you can focus on what matters, the creativity. [music]'

[00:13] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Motion co-pilot doesn\'t just create your key frames. It can add effects and a whole lot more. And [music] then, you take over. Edit your animation exactly the way you want in a graph editor much like the one you already know.'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Adding interactivity is easier than ever before. Connect a node or just prompt your way there with state machines. &gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; Now your animation reacts to every state.'

[00:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Drop a motion token on text, color, or any other property. Change it once and it updates everywhere. Bring those tokens together and motion becomes part of your design system. Once you define it, your whole team stays in'

[00:50] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'sync. That\'s motion system. And if the plugin you want doesn\'t exist yet, build it and share it in the bizarre. Then export production-ready [music] files your developer just ships.'

[01:02] [scene:talk]
